.TH geectl-update 1  "geectl-update 0.2.4" 
.SH NAME
geectl\-update \- Update the working copy in the current directory to the latest base
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBgeectl update\fR [\fB\-\-rev\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] 
.SH DESCRIPTION
Update the working copy in the current directory to the latest base
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-rev\fR \fI<REV>\fR
The revision to update to: an OBS revision number or source md5 for an OBS\-native package, a git SHA for a git\-backed package. The latest when omitted
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.SH VERSION
v0.2.4
